{"lines":[{"id":"s1","text":"You stir wasabi into the soy sauce.|The chef freezes."},{"id":"s2","text":"Everyone freezes.|Wrong move."},{"id":"s3","text":"Sushi rules."},{"id":"s4","text":"Wasabi's inside."},{"id":"s5","text":"He smiles.|Dip the fish."},{"id":"s6","text":"He—"},{"id":"s7","text":"You wait.|He shapes the next piece."},{"id":"s8","text":"One clean bite.|No tears."},{"id":"s9","text":"Wasabi inside. Chef happy."},{"id":"n1","text":"Wasabi inside.|Don't stir it in."},{"id":"n2","text":"Fish side down.|Never the rice."},{"id":"n3","text":"Chopsticks or fingers.|Both fine."},{"id":"n4","text":"That's Japan first times.|Follow for more."}],"rate":"+8%","voice":"en-US-GuyNeural"}